  "term": "CCRT",
  "definition": "CCRT stands for computerized cognitive remediation therapy, a computer-based approach intended to improve cognitive deficits. In the supplied source, it is described as a promising method for reducing cognitive and negative symptoms in people with schizophrenia.",
